[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "I don't remember anything else."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "But you see? "
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "I've forgotten everything."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "This place is closing today."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "The owner's shutting us down, "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "and moving back to his hometown."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "It'd be nice to go home, too."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "Since it's the last day, are you "
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "expecting something special?"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "What are you expecting?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Why do you listen?"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Well, it doesn't matter.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "I never really expected to know."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "You came here almost every day,"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Paid to hear me ramble on."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "And that gave me as much happiness "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "as I can hope for."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "After falling this far,"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": " there's nothing left to lose."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Everyday as joyless as "
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "the one before it..."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "With eyes closed, I continued to "
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": " endure my existence..."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "But I feel that I've been able to "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "open them just a little..."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": " "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Today, since it's our last chance,"
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "I want to hear your voice."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Let me hear what you sound like,"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "who you are..."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Just once..."
  }
]